      "cooked": "<p><strong>Mobile Defense Platform</strong></p><p>This is the Baron Blades plotting fortress. Home to blade battalions, and equipment.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;Here's some pointers to help with storming this place.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>Types of Cards: Rooms - Levels, minions, structures</li>\n<li>Number of target cards: 10 -&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>Special Mention: <b>Propulsion System -&nbsp;</b>Has ten HP if it reaches 0 game over</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Routine Observation</strong>:This Environment is one of the easier ones. It has ten targets, but three of them reduce damge dealt to environment targets, one you don't want to destroy, and the others do minor damage. The three level cards add some to the damage, but not a lot. In my experience the targets add up quick, but there's usually nothing critical to worth hitting it with damage.</li>\n</ul><ul><li>Dificulty rank - 1 (According to the wiki)</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;Villains with this environment</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Akash Bhuta is fond of targets, she'd feed off this environment well.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Baron Blade works well thematically with this environment.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Grand Warlord Voss - The minions count for his damage reduction which can make for a difficult fight if things pile up and count toward win condtitions.</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Heros with this environment</strong></p><ul><li>\n<b>The Naturalist</b>: Is fond of environment targets for his card that does DR based on # of environment targets.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anything I should add? Tips thoughts? Suggestions? Anything you suggest will added. Thanks for the help!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:56.153Z",
