      "id": 143254,
      "name": "mackcrockett",
      "username": "mackcrockett",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-28T10:41:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>theres a lockout with this environment that makes it stop doing what little it did. If the last level through the deck returns targets to the bottom and one of the mechanics is in play, you can kill the mechanic over and over with area damage and the environment will just keep playing him.&nbsp;</p><p>A single mega computer completely nerfs the environment into irrelevance.</p><p>The return targets to the bottom of the deck card can be exploited against Blade, Dawn, Chairman, Capitan, Matriarch (basically the same list as with Freedom Tower, it's a bit less powerful against Blade)&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Personally, I find this environment to be basically a no-show in most games.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
