      "created_at": "2015-06-28T17:22:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, we often end up just able to ignore this as long as someone can soak the plinks off the Minions (if/when they come out). Otherwise generally you end up with all the shields out so don't really have to worry about hitting the propulsion systems if they come out as well. Makes it a change from those environments that just stack up to kill you or mess you up in a variety of nasty ways ;).</p>",
