    {
      "id": 143256,
      "name": "AlexxKay",
      "username": "AlexxKay",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-29T00:16:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's no accident that this and Freedom Tower, the two easiest environments in the game, were released with the Vengeance expansion.&nbsp; When you're dealing with an entire team on opposing villains, it can be nice to not worry about the environment, too.</p><p>(Essentially avoiding the problem with Rook City, where both the villains *and* the environments were super-punishing.)</p>",
